    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build capacity through sustainable livelihoods opportunities, income generating activities for vulnerable communities including persons with disabilities for building resilience.
Capacities of national, Zoba and Sub-zoba level stakeholders to identify disaster and climate risks, to manage risks and to prepare for protecting people the disaster threats through developing risk informed planning and implementation enhanced,</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved Disaster Risk Reduction capacity at national sub-national and local levels
Provided emergency preparedness capacity enhancement of communities with non-food items for high disaster risk prone areas (volcano and drought) of Northern and Southern Red Sea and Anseba zones.
Provided short term income Generating Activities (IGA) to 1,000 (households) through soil and water conservation activities focusing on women headed households, youth, and persons with disability.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
